 4. 🐶 1 fun thing: Mayor bud 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Courtesy of Annie Morris Grandview, Ohio, residents recently picked the city's first "dog mayor," Axios Columbus' Andrew King reports. 

 🦮 "Grandview girl" Tater was crowned winner of the inaugural election Friday in the neighborhood just outside Columbus.

 She was sworn in and gave an acceptance speech on the spot. 🐿️ Among Tater's campaign promises: more biscuits, a longer dog swimming season, and a close watch on the area's squirrel population.

